DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppaamm__eerrrroorr() function displays an error message through the intermedi‐
     ary of the given PAM context's conversation function.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     The ppaamm__eerrrroorr() function returns one of the following values:

     [PAM_SUCCESS]       Success.

     [PAM_BUF_ERR]       Memory buffer error.

     [PAM_CONV_ERR]      Conversation failure.

     [PAM_SYSTEM_ERR]    System error.

